        "text": "10\nChapter 1 I Mastering the Terminal Window\nManaging Users and Groups in Kali\nUnderstanding the commands for managing users and groups is important\nbecause you\u2019ll use the information when you learn about privilege escalation\nlater in the book. All the commands in this chapter will help you a lot in your\nengagements while using Kali Linux (as an OS for your pentests).\nFigure 1.5 summarizes all the commands related to users\u2019 management/\nsecurity in Kali Linux.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Users Commands\n\u2022 Groups Commands\n\u2022 Managing Passwords in Kali\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
